‘Yes, but not from us. Too late - she's going red.’
‘Makes sense, I suppose.’ Laura hummed. ‘Dad being the last Ferrari champion and all that.’ ​
‘She’s speedy… Anyway, I got him the drive here. He should show a bit more loyalty to me for it.’ Hannah grumbled.
